580/extras/e5aa866e1773505e41efc26b4eaff5db.mp4?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/9fb2a4a88e5a65191800192be0c4bb15.avif?t=1785753412\" width=700 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controlling the entire team</strong> also allows players to take tactical advantage of each hero’s <strong>special strengths</strong> and <strong>even the odds against the abominations with powerful combos</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some combos are <strong>a 1-2 punch</strong> where <strong>timing is everything</strong>, such as <strong>Harsk weakening foes with poison</strong> before they face <strong>Kyra’s slashing scimitar</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other combos let heroes <strong>create something entirely new</strong> – for example, <strong>Ezren’s wall of fire</strong> becomes a<i> </i><strong>flame vortex</strong> when <strong>Amiri spins her sword</strong>, a<i> </i><strong>flame wave</strong> when <strong>Harsk swings his dual axes</strong>, or a <strong>wide-ranging fire dome</strong> when <strong>Kyra strikes the ground with her magic</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/974094614bce97ce024ca54778d0b3fc.poster.avif?t=1785753412\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/974094614bce97ce024ca54778d0b3fc.webm?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/974094614bce97ce024ca54778d0b3fc.mp4?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/38d23c4cb12f00e351d248f1d9770494.avif?t=1785753412\" width=700 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero in <strong>Pathfinder: Abomination Vaults</strong> can be <strong>customized via various advancement paths</strong>. Players choose how to improve each <strong>hero's abilities</strong> as they level up to <strong>create the kind of hero they want to play</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, <strong>Kyra the cleric</strong> is a vital <strong>support character</strong> with her <strong>starting healing magic</strong>, but those spell effects can be <strong>altered to increase their range, add damage, or add additional protection</strong>, transforming Kyra from <strong>healer</strong> into a <strong>powerful blaster</strong> or a <strong>mighty frontliner</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/010b0d3c14d6d9947a351f18bb6c7416.poster.avif?t=1785753412\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/010b0d3c14d6d9947a351f18bb6c7416.webm?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/010b0d3c14d6d9947a351f18bb6c7416.mp4?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/a801354c0c9410f73f7c051990b7fa99.avif?t=1785753412\" width=700 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can <strong>join forces with up to 3 other friends</strong> in <strong>local or online co-op</strong> for a <strong>fast &amp; friendly pick-up adventure</strong> - either right <strong>from the beginning</strong>, during a <strong>tough boss fight</strong>, or just because they’ve <strong>discovered a new part of the dungeon and want to share the experience</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/3862e2e685541cb3e00545cee220f362.poster.avif?t=1785753412\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/3862e2e685541cb3e00545cee220f362.webm?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/3862e2e685541cb3e00545cee220f362.mp4?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/27b810cd41cf5d80e0d3b013d47e0555.avif?t=1785753412\" width=700 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/fbee69658465f694e436115268471197.avif?t=1785753412\" width=606 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pathfinder: Abomination Vaults is an epic adventure where cooperative play is key to defeating Belcorra's abominations and immersing yourself in the adventure.</strong> Are you ready to face the challenge and rescue Golarion? Prepare yourself for an unparalleled journey like none other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Pathfinder: Abomination Vaults to your wishlist now.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/308fedd34930aeb19a6e3f5cab225e23.poster.avif?t=1785753412\" width=512 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/308fedd34930aeb19a6e3f5cab225e23.webm?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/extras/308fedd34930aeb19a6e3f5cab225e23.mp4?t=1785753412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Pathfinder: Abomination Vaults is the first-ever co-op Hack and Slash ARPG based on the Adventure Path, in which players lead iconic Pathfinder heroes into the depths of Gauntlight Keep and battle deadly abominations to reach the evil sorceress Belcorra Haruvex and end her vile schemes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/1e52a354f9e5c476e9974ab91e552d5fa8732688/header.jpg?t=1785753412", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/1ab0b3bf55e3245da4d06ee731b5fc2ae88229a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785753412", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666580/1ab0b3bf55e3245da4d06ee731b5fc2ae88229a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785753412", "website": null, "pc_r